route: /*/
memory:
  - This is the default landing page after sign-in; the URL is just /:workspaceSlug/.
  - The center widgets (Quick links, Stickies, Recents, "Manage widgets") render no stable attributes — no ids, no data-* hooks. They are only reachable as T2 under MainContent; drive them by accessible name.

